{"text":"孝昌二年四月廿三日，紫內司尼為亡女尼法暉敬造彌勒尊像一區。願此善資，離苦得樂。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"法暉","refId":null,"text":"法暉","start":18,"end":20},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":22,"end":24},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"離苦","refId":null,"text":"離苦","start":34,"end":36},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"得洛","refId":null,"text":"得樂","start":36,"end":38}]}